this is fixed in the 1.3 release. In the meantime, modify the file
/usr/lib/X11/app-defaults/Mwm and remove the word 'kill' from the
line: 
 Mwm*showFeedback:       behavior placement quit restart kill

the problem is that Mwm is trying to put up a dialog box to ask you
if you want it to be killed and does not realize that the connection is
lost.


