SGI tape devices do byte swapping.  I've never tried reading such a tape on
a OSF/1 host, but have on ULTRIX, Sun OS, etc.  Something like the following
should work.  (The key is 'conv=swab').

dd if=/dev/tape ibs=64512 conv=swab,sync,noerror | tar xovf -

